3. $i(i-1) + j(j+1) \le R^2 - 0.5$
4. $i(i-1) + j(j-1) \le R^2 - 0.5$

Since $i(i+1) \ge i(i-1)$ and $j(j+1) \ge j(j-1)$, the first condition $i(i+1) + j(j+1) \le R^2 - 0.5$ implies the others?
